		<br>
	<</if>>*/
<</if>>

:: Doren Club Unbind

<<npc doren>><<person1>>

Doren takes a moment to search around the club room for an implement to free you, but <<he>> eventually frees you.

<<link [[Next|Club Room]]>><<unbind>><</link>>
